### Question requests
# REST Client file for question endpoints.

### Questions - Generate questions
POST {{baseUrl}}/questions/generate
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "userEmail": "user@example.com",
  "category": "Math",
  "subCategory": "Algebra",
  "subject": "Linear equations",
  "language": "en",
  "count": 5,
  "prompt": "Generate 5 multiple-choice algebra questions."
}

### Questions - Regenerate questions
POST {{baseUrl}}/questions/regenerate-questions
Content-Type: application/json
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

{
  "prompt": "Regenerate these questions with easier wording.",
  "questions": [
    { "_id": "questionId1", "question": "..." }
  ]
}

### Questions - Get categories by user email
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions/categories/user@example.com
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Questions - Get subcategories
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions/subcategories
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}

### Questions - Get questions
GET {{baseUrl}}/questions?userEmail=user@example.com&category=Math&subCategory=Algebra
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
